{"ticker":"GPN","updated":"2026-11-20T22:57:48Z","profile":{"longName":"Global Payments Inc.","shortName":"Global Payments Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Business Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.globalpayments.com","fullTimeEmployees":26000,"marketCap":24301506560,"trailingPE":163.98215,"forwardPE":5.6727595,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.1143656,"pegRatio":0.2,"targetMeanPrice":109.30303,"targetHighPrice":194.0,"targetLowPrice":70.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":33,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.637,"earningsGrowth":-0.599,"grossMargins":0.61576,"operatingMargins":0.17211,"profitMargins":-0.112110004,"totalRevenue":11493521408,"beta":0.816,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":102.91,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":61.16,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.2},"summary":"Global Payments Inc. provides payment technology and software solutions for card, check, and digital-based payments in the Americas, Europe, and the Asia-Pacific. It offers authorization, settlement and funding, customer support, chargeback resolution, reconciliation and dispute management, terminal rental, sales and deployment, payment security, and consolidated billing and reporting services. The company also provides an array of enterprise software solutions that streamline business operations of its customers in various vertical markets; and value-added solutions and services, such as point-of-sale software, analytics and customer engagement, payroll and reporting, and human capital management. It markets its products and services through direct sales force, trade associations, agent and enterprise software providers, referral arrangements with value-added resellers, independent sales organizations, payment facilitators, and financial institutions. The company was founded in 1967 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"Global Payments Inc. 為美洲、歐洲和亞太地區的銀行卡、支票和數位支付提供支付技術和軟體解決方案。它提供授權、結算和資金、客戶支援、退款解決、對帳和爭議管理、終端租賃、銷售和部署、支付安全以及綜合計費和報告服務。該公司還提供一系列企業軟體解決方案，簡化各個垂直市場客戶的業務運營；增值解決方案和服務，例如銷售點軟體、分析和客戶參與、工資和報告以及人力資本管理。它透過直銷團隊、行業協會、代理商和企業軟體提供者、與增值經銷商、獨立銷售組織、支付服務商和金融機構的推薦安排來行銷其產品和服務。該公司成立於 1967 年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"專業商業服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":85.96,"h":87.31,"l":85.61,"c":86.95,"v":3095900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":86.88,"h":88.33,"l":86.0,"c":86.11,"v":3168700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":86.29,"h":87.84,"l":86.23,"c":87.11,"v":2123600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":86.39,"h":87.09,"l":84.78,"c":84.9,"v":2184700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":84.91,"h":85.41,"l":84.03,"c":84.32,"v":2205400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":85.84,"h":86.88,"l":84.17,"c":86.34,"v":3199200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":86.04,"h":86.27,"l":81.98,"c":83.08,"v":3422100},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":83.1,"h":85.52,"l":83.1,"c":85.12,"v":1796200},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":84.83,"h":86.72,"l":84.75,"c":86.42,"v":2059900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":86.59,"h":88.56,"l":86.01,"c":87.96,"v":1990800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":88.91,"h":88.99,"l":86.48,"c":87.18,"v":1453200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":87.66,"h":88.69,"l":87.06,"c":88.1,"v":1642200},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":88.74,"h":88.8,"l":87.23,"c":88.53,"v":1363600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":88.87,"h":89.58,"l":86.56,"c":87.18,"v":1720900},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":87.12,"h":87.43,"l":82.81,"c":82.85,"v":2601400},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":83.67,"h":84.75,"l":83.35,"c":84.22,"v":1218000},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":83.18,"h":86.92,"l":83.09,"c":86.47,"v":1993700},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":86.64,"h":87.29,"l":85.26,"c":86.1,"v":1267000},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":86.0,"h":86.34,"l":83.65,"c":83.66,"v":1855900},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":83.68,"h":85.6,"l":83.65,"c":85.42,"v":2372300},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":85.84,"h":87.22,"l":85.52,"c":87.02,"v":1262700},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":86.99,"h":88.22,"l":86.5,"c":87.66,"v":1282400},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":86.5,"h":87.38,"l":85.62,"c":85.67,"v":1787000},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":86.83,"h":88.2,"l":86.53,"c":87.48,"v":1184700},{"t":"2025-10-24","o":88.69,"h":89.01,"l":87.34,"c":87.36,"v":1286700},{"t"